## ✅ Conventions

- **Commits** — [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/) (`type(scope): description`), enforced by a `commit-msg` hook.
- **Imports** — `@/` maps to `./src/`, e.g. `import { env } from "@/env"`.
- **Environment** — a new variable goes into `src/env.ts` and `.env.example` in the same commit.
